---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Hayvex"
  description="Privacy Policy for Hayvex."
>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">
    Privacy Policy
  </h1>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-zinc-300 leading-8">

    <p>
      Hayvex is a privacy-first OCR platform developed by Vaikva.
    </p>

    <p>
      Documents are processed directly inside your browser whenever
      possible. We do not intentionally collect or store the documents
      you upload.
    </p>

    <p>
      We may collect anonymous analytics such as browser type,
      operating system and page visits to improve the product.
    </p>

    <p>
      We do not sell personal information.
    </p>

    <p>
      If this policy changes, this page will be updated.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>